{"id":"8fa0cc7c74aae956","group":"93","path":"93/93-lem-valuation-extension.md","title":"Valuation Extension","display":"Valuation Extension","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-lem-valuation-extension","aliases":["93-lem-valuation-extension"],"display":"Valuation Extension","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-valuation]]","[[93-df-term]]","[[93-df-variable]]","[[93-df-homomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-lem-valuation-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-lem-valuation-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Valuation Extension"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8181bcdfbad8d73a\" href=\"?note=8181bcdfbad8d73a\" title=\"93-df-valuation\">93-df-valuation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca7404158049be33\" href=\"?note=ca7404158049be33\" title=\"93-df-term\">93-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"11b62d0ad578fa42\" href=\"?note=11b62d0ad578fa42\" title=\"93-df-variable\">93-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-valuation-extension---Valuation-Extension\">lem-valuation-extension - Valuation Extension</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\)</span> is a similarity type, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:X\\to|\\mathbf A|\">\\(v:X\\to|\\mathbf A|\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{App}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{App}_{93}\\)</span> is the tagged constructor of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ca7404158049be33\" href=\"?note=ca7404158049be33\" title=\"93-df-term\">93-df-term</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}\\)</span> is the explicit tuple map of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\land X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\n\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land v:X\\to|\\mathbf A|\\bigr)\n\\to\\exists!h\\;\\Bigl[h:T_{\\tau}(X)\\to|\\mathbf A|\\land h|_X=v\n\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;\\forall\\bar t\\in T_{\\tau}(X)^{\\alpha(f)}\\;\n\\Bigl(h(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t))=\nf^{\\mathbf A}(\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}(h,\\alpha(f),\\bar t))\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\land X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\n\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land v:X\\to|\\mathbf A|\\bigr)\n\\to\\exists!h\\;\\Bigl[h:T_{\\tau}(X)\\to|\\mathbf A|\\land h|_X=v\n\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;\\forall\\bar t\\in T_{\\tau}(X)^{\\alpha(f)}\\;\n\\Bigl(h(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t))=\nf^{\\mathbf A}(\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}(h,\\alpha(f),\\bar t))\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Every variable assignment extends uniquely to term evaluation.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-valuation-extension---Valuation-Extension","text":"lem-valuation-extension - Valuation Extension","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-valuation","status":"resolved","id":"8181bcdfbad8d73a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-valuation]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"ca7404158049be33","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"11b62d0ad578fa42","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f10e7e3251fa7f7d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"ca7404158049be33","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle$ is a similarity type, $X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}$, $\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)$, and $v:X\\to|\\mathbf A|$; $\\operatorname{App}_{93}$ is the tagged constructor of [[93-df-term]], and $\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}$ is the explicit tuple map of [[93-df-homomorphism]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f10e7e3251fa7f7d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle$ is a similarity type, $X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}$, $\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)$, and $v:X\\to|\\mathbf A|$; $\